{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Lucky and Cooper continue the work the Viola and him began last night.\nWhile the boots are now complete; Lucky and I more our attention to Rose Cutter.\nLucky’s magical attunement guides coppers strikes flawlessly. If it weren’t for him here assisting, copper isnt sure if they could have been able to do this artifact justice.\nBut with Lucky guiding him, they breath life back into this sword. Copper uses his own fire breath to heat the sword for reforging. Of course he could use the actual forge to do this, but he wants to add something personal to it, the heart of a dragon. \nLucky and copper, working together, will see that this sword shall soon shine as brightly as it once did.","created_at":"2020-08-19T20:18:24.290000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745738461155426464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
