{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Web nods. \"Hiram not good at explaining exactly what plan is or how works. And if know John, well.... not exactly forthcoming with details.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:48:47.568000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746093396908572673","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Not their project, so can't expect to know everything. But hope Dregen can explain better.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:50:57.807000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-20T19:51:02.201000Z","id":"746093943170662500","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Plan is to unmake the Hunger is to use it's greatest desire as a weapon against it. Best way to deal with sumthin ravenous is to feed it sumthin it canna no eat.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:51:04.653000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746093971884998746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Web nods. \"Hiram mention 'poisoned divinity'? What makes poisoned?\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:51:44.935000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746094140839821455","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"The Will and Intentions of them whose lives were added to it. Them what served in life to stop it would see their end be it's end too.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:52:31.674000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746094336877264968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Old tinkers and masons? Hiram mentioned about that.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:53:02.123000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746094464589627414","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Sacrifice is old magic. Older than the hunger, an somethin that it could never under stand nor protect itself against.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:53:30.967000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-20T19:53:46.281000Z","id":"746094585570394143","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Old tinkers. Old Masons, Two halves of the same coin.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:54:28.063000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746094825048375318","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Can't have balance with out both.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:54:50.276000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746094918216187960","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Hiram was that balance.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:55:28.453000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746095078342131825","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Fully tinker, Master Mason.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:55:40.831000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746095130259226684","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Must have been working for long time. What makes sacrifice strong enough?\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:56:02.624000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746095221665693747","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"They nod regarding Hiram.","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:56:10.509000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746095254737780857","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"He part of sacrifice now?\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:56:32.049000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746095345083220129","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Every bone here. Not a one of them chose to move on after death. Chose to wait until that feckin fat sack of acid and death was done for.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:57:24.898000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-20T19:58:31.365000Z","id":"746095566748123168","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"The Ossuary is built to keep them. Preserving them for a time when there were enough.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:57:47.919000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746095663304933396","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Web main concern that hunger ate gods, consumed them. And gods committed to ending hunger too, like masons and tinkers. How know not make stronger?\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:59:05.925000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746095990485942375","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"They pause \"Sorry to ask so many questions.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T19:59:18.539000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746096043393024052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Because these souls set their intentions. Sacrifice binds it and keeps it from being anything other than intended. You may have heard Daysong speak about the power of intention.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:01:22.409000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746096562941460569","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Their will to fight is still present.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:02:17.571000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746096794307657739","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Web nods. \"Had chisel for a time. Experienced it myself. Did gods not set intentions?\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:02:31.190000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746096851429621891","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Gods come in a full spectrum. Not one like another. Their conflicts have brought the old world to waste more often than not. Conflict is the opposite of intention. Some would help. Others would see the end come so as to set up their kingdoms and claims on the material plane.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:04:14.298000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746097283896180846","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Web thinks for a moment.","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:04:39.636000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746097390171193454","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
